    "quantity": 1,
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A fat, dog-eared ledger of debts, prices, and who-owes-whom across the Thatwards. While carried, you have an edge on any negotiation, bribe, or appraisal. The Jackalopes update theirs hourly. Yours is probably out of date and still better than nothing.</p><p><strong>Use.</strong> Once per scene, recall an exact figure or favor to reroll the lowest die on a single Intrigue or Economy check.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    }
